Rule 7 (difference order n must be less than the size of the array along the specified axis)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : int, v_3 : int} |= if v_3 ≥ 0 then v_2 < shape(v_1, v_3) else v_2 < shape(v_1, v_3 + ndim(v_1))
