Rule 22 (append tensor must have the same shape as input tensor except along the specified axis)
{v_1 : tensor, v_3 : int, v_5 : tensor} |= ndim(v_5) = ndim(v_1) ∧ ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : (if (v_3 < 0 ∧ i = v_3 + ndim(v_1)) ∨ (v_3 ≥ 0 ∧ i = v_3) then true else shape(v_5, i) = shape(v_1, i))
